    "P2": "Word memory ASL/LSR/ROL/ROR/INC/DEC/TSB/TRB write high before low, preserving low-first ordinary stores. Counting-bus regressions cover every memory form, values, byte/word widths, native/emulation modes, $2118/$2119, bank-zero wrapping, bank carry and 24-bit wrapping.",
